  "details": "I have a couple requests in terms of features \n-   in-game blacklisting system to keep problematic players from using your content as a creator (this could also help out with widely known community disturbances using a community's hub, like crashers, rippers or bullies)\n-   a way to manually set ik values for hip max hip / neck angle bending, in hopes of eliminating crazy neck folding \n-   lobby text chat, with reasonable filters for inappropriate words / links, with options to have sub chats or threats in said text chat (I feel this would help out a lot with deaf and mute/selectively mute players)\n-   in-game dming system to dm your friends, again with reasonable filters\n-   I already sent this in general but an avatar searching tab to search via keywords/user id\n-   Even more favorites?? Sorry to sound gluttonous- you could even put it behind a paywall (or even unlimited favorites as a feature, behind a paywall probably)\n-   a way to show dynamic bones/physbones for specific trust ranks (ex., only being able to see the physbones of friends)\nIf any of these are already implemented and I'm just dense please let me know",
